      "id": "p0205-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In modern Japanese, atashi is an informal, feminine personal pronoun. Atashi is less formal than watashi, and is far more common in everyday Japanese than achishi. Other fictional characters who use atashi include:",
